<LanguageData>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Label>锁定激光</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Description>选择一个单位，蓄力一秒后持续追踪目标的聚焦激光。每秒消耗0.5%最大能量，每轮最多持续十秒。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Tracking.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Label>横扫激光</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Description>依次选择两个可见地点，蓄力一秒后发射横扫激光，每秒消耗0.5%最大能量。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Sweep.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopTracking.Label>停止锁定激光</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopTracking.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopSweep.Label>停止横扫激光</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.StopSweep.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Stop.Description>中止激光发射。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Stop.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NotDrafted>仅在征召时可用。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NotDrafted>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Emergency>紧急着陆期间无法发射。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Emergency>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Cooldown>激光系统冷却中：{0}秒。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Cooldown>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NoEnergy>能量不足以释放下一次脉冲。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.NoEnergy>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Busy>另一种激光正在发射。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Busy>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Unavailable>当前战车无法发射激光。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ChariotLaser.Disabled.Unavailable>
